<title>HONG KONG: Kingboard Chem interim net up 48.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Kingboard Chem interim net up 48.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   15.9   vs  11.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0    vs  1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    52.57  vs  35.44</p>
<p>    Turnover		     366.18 vs  260.80</p>
<p>    Company name		 Kingboard Chemical Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 28-31, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   February 3, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Kingboard Chemical Holdings is a manufacturer of laminates.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
